 "recognition_note": "The antigen was identified from cutoff-filtered records as the HCMV gH/gL/UL128/UL130/UL131A pentamer. The paired F/G Fab was not identified: exact heavy- and light-chain hits belonged to different unrelated antibodies, and pre-cutoff HCMV-pentamer Fab sequences did not match the pair. No published epitope for this binder was found.",
 "what_separated_them": "No candidate had Tier A evidence about this binder, so the distribution remains broad. Weak separation came from calculations applied uniformly to all fixed footprints: coverability, assembly exposure and burial, glycan sequons, and exposed-SASA-weighted chemistry against this Fab. C5 led on compact positive/polar complementarity; C3 and C6 combined favorable chemistry with independent HCMV antibody and functional precedent. Over-wide C1/C8 footprints and membrane/charge concerns for C9 moved them down. Published maps of other antibodies were treated only as Tier B precedent.",
